{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36208","headline":"陪王大夫泛湖 · 方干","name":"陪王大夫泛湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去去凌晨回见星，木兰舟稳画桡轻。\n白波潭上鱼龙气，红树林中鸡犬声。\n蜜炬烧残银汉昃，羽觞飞急玉山倾。\n此时检点诸名士，却是渔翁无姓名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}